flowchart TB
  %% A TB diagram whose subgraph declares direction LR and has edges that
  %% cross its boundary (Start -> A, C -> Finish). Mermaid ignores the
  %% subgraph's direction here and lays its members out top to bottom.
  Start[Start] --> A
  subgraph Lane [Crossing lane]
    direction LR
    A[Alpha] --> B[Beta] --> C[Gamma]
  end
  C --> Finish[Finish]
  Start --> Side[Side path] --> Finish
